issues.least_adequate_overall_repair:
No complete source-supported repair identified. At minimum, a repair must do one of the following:
- control the kink (local-time) contribution of p_b and p_w at Γ in the penalization estimate, e.g. via sign conditions on the jumps [∇_n p] ensuring convexity/concavity in the favourable direction, which excludes the paper's own example;
- or fall back to the λ^{-1/2} rate and re-derive the a priori bounds and the parameter couplings.

issues.overall_effect:
Several advertised results become unsupported:
- the O(1/λ) penalization rate;
- the λ-uniform penalty bounds of Corollary stoapb;
- the λ-independent a priori estimates of Proposition xyzbound and Corollary apbcor, which use stoapb;
- every total-error rate and tuning rule built on them, including the headline O(Δt^{1/2}).
